<gpx version="1.1" creator="Ultrainfo (converted from the organizer's official course GPX download)" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>The Drift 100 course</name>
    <desc>Track points and station waypoints copy the organizer's official GPX download (a CalTopo export linked from thedrift100.com/100-mile-course, retrieved 2026-08-13); the download's non-station Green Creek Safety Shelter waypoint is omitted. Point to point from the Green River Trailhead to Kendall Valley Lodge; the line GPS-measures 103.1 miles against the aid table's 101-mile cumulative frame, which governs pass miles. The official line carries no elevations.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.thedrift100.com/100-mile-course/"><text>The Drift 100 course page</text></link>
  </metadata>
